{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警旺角破毒窟一漢疑高處墮下　送院不治\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FALL-MK-261026-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方在旺角掃毒期間，一名男子懷疑從高處墮下，送院不治。</p><p>二十多名男女黑布蒙頭被押上警車帶返警署調查。周日晚上9時許，警方有組織罪案及三合會調查科人員</p><p>突擊搜查新填地街387號一個單位，一名42歲男子懷疑逃走期間失足由高處墮下受傷，送院後證實不治。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.577425+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:31:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:11.318672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:00.542100+00:00","content_hash":"46fa07c2bb9b4883ec64b41924bdef410268fb0b110c2d1265eec5104994c2fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.577425+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}